         ->  Parallel Custom Scan (TessSend)
               ->  Parallel Custom Scan (TessAgg)
                     Partial Mode: Partial
                     ->  Parallel Custom Scan (TessHashJoin)
                           Hash Cond: (jrefprobe.k = jref.k)
                           Shared Table: true
                           ->  Parallel Custom Scan (TessHeapScan) on jref
                           ->  Parallel Custom Scan (TessHeapScan) on jrefprobe
(12 rows)

